# NOTE: When package.json sets the `files` allowlist, npm ignores this
# file entirely for anything inside the allowlisted directories. So we
# can't use .npmignore to strip `dist/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo` -- that is
# handled by setting `tsBuildInfoFile` in tsconfig.json to point outside
# the `dist/` tree, keeping the build cache out of the tarball by
# construction rather than by post-hoc exclusion.
#
# This file remains only to exclude things that might sneak into the
# package root without being in the `files` allowlist (editor files,
# OS droppings). Everything inside `dist/` must be filtered via
# tsconfig or a prepack hook, not via this file.

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
